17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Standard Precautions apply to every patient in every encounter: blood, all body fluids except sweat, non-intact skin, and mucous membranes are treated as potentially infectious. In direct care this is not an abstraction — it governs most of what you do all day."}]
